<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Ossified Frame</ansi> mutation

Your skeleton thickens and fuses into a single braced structure,
rooted through the hips like an old oak.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive (Colossus)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Nothing can take you off your feet — you cannot be knocked down,
  tripped, or grappled — and your braced frame toughens you

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly easier to hit — the rigidity costs you a fraction of your
  ability to slip a blow

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
